From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:07:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(power): apply Piano normal charging tables

Use the CN normal CC/CV and JEITA tables with an 8 A combined-cell ceiling, profile-bound PMIC float voltage and confirmed 3.5 s tail-charge handover. Keep the validated bounded PMIC heat-sharing path.

Bind voltage and current updates to one ADSP/connector session. Stop on missing readings, preserve temperature recovery hysteresis and use the factory SC8541 battery protections. Pause PMIC charging before suspend or teardown while host JEITA cannot run.

Signed-off-by: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
